Description: A client for 'HL7 FHIR' R4 servers (search with automatic
    paging, read, create, update, delete, transactions and the '$everything',
    '$validate' and bulk data '$export' operations, with 'SMART on FHIR'
    'OAuth2' authentication), terminology operations ('$expand', '$lookup'
    and '$validate-code') to define views with value sets, and an engine
    that turns FHIR resources into tables following the 'SQL on FHIR'
    'ViewDefinition' specification <https://sql-on-fhir.org/>. 'FHIRPath'
    expressions are evaluated with
    the 'fhirpath.js' library through the 'V8' package; an experimental
    second engine translates views to 'DuckDB' SQL to process millions of
    resources from 'NDJSON' or 'Parquet' files. Includes the official 'SQL on
    FHIR' conformance test suite, explicit mappings from database query
    results to FHIR R4 Patient, Observation, Encounter, Condition and
    Immunization, Specimen and DiagnosticReport resources,
    export of views to 'DuckDB', and
    integration with the 'RStudio' Connections pane and addins.
    Documentation is in Spanish.
